            <h2>Project Overview</h2>
            <p>This course provides a thorough exploration of Entity Framework Core, from fundamentals to advanced techniques. Whether you&rsquo;re new to EF Core or looking to deepen your expertise, this course covers the patterns and practices you need to build robust data access layers.</p>

            <h2>What You&rsquo;ll Learn</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Setting up and configuring Entity Framework Core</li>
                <li>Modeling relationships and complex data structures</li>
                <li>Querying data efficiently with LINQ</li>
                <li>Migrations, seeding, and database management</li>
                <li>Performance optimization and best practices</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="service-nav">
                <a href="/Projects/WoodyShow">&larr; The Woody Show</a>
